  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop parsley.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• Drain sweetcorn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65e6b4dfdb00aeaaefcb6b42-1cc9c316.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large ovenproof saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook soffritto mix and sweetcorn, stirring, until softened, 6-7 minutes.\n• Add half the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65e6b4dfdb00aeaaefcb6b42-6bc0c39e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add cannellini beans and All-American spice blend to the pan. Cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, the salt, BBQ sauce and the water. Cook, stirring, until well combined, 2-3 minutes. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65e6b4dfdb00aeaaefcb6b42-8518872c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Sprinkle evenly with Cheddar cheese and cover with a lid or foil.\n• Bake until thickened and cheese is melted, 10-12 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65e6b4dfdb00aeaaefcb6b42-502793df.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice bake-at-home ciabatta in half lengthways, then slice each half diagonally across.\n• Place the butter and remaining garlic in a small heatproof bowl. Microwave in 10 second bursts until melted. Stir through half the parsley. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Brush garlic butter over the cut-side of ciabatta slices.\n• Place ciabatta slices directly on a wire rack in the oven. Bake until golden, 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65e6b4dfdb00aeaaefcb6b42-0a3b43db.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide BBQ baked beans between bowls.\n• Garnish with remaining parsley. Sprinkle with pickled jalapeños (if using).\n• Serve with herby garlic bread. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65e6b4dfdb00aeaaefcb6b42-8adab3f2.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
